  "name": "Blueberry Chocolate Torte",
  "subtitle": "A layered chocolate dessert with blueberries and cream",
  "description": "A crisp pastry base supports a light chocolate sponge, blueberry gelée, and softly whipped cream, finished with fresh berries.",
